# LauerTeam — Organisation

Persönliche Projekte unter `/opt/TunnelQuiz/` — **Apps/** (GUI + ggf. eine App-API) und **Domains/** (Daten + Domain-API). GUI spricht nur die eigene App-API. Details: `/opt/TunnelQuiz/README.md`. ADR Domain-Split: `.cursor/brain/adr/0001-lauerteam-domain-split.md`. Agent-SSOT: `.cursor/brain/adr/0007-agent-ssot-org-root.md`.

## Layout

| Pfad | Rolle |
|------|-------|
| `Domains/myProjectsDomain/` | Todos, Projekt-Register |
| `Domains/myAgentsDomain/` | Agent-Rechte, Runtime-API (kein File-Hub) |
| `Domains/myBrainDomain/` | Dokumente / Wissen |
| `Domains/myUserDomain/` | Identität, app-übergreifende Prefs |
| `Domains/myOpsDomain/` | KPI, Quota, Health |
| `Domains/myRoutinesDomain/` | Ablauf-Graphen |
| `Domains/myGunsDomain/` | Waffenwissen |
| `Domains/myDownloadsDomain/` | Binärdateien (Downloads) |
| `Apps/myUIApp/` | Cockpit-GUI (`myUI-app-web`) + myUI-app-api — `https://myui.lauer.team` |
| `Apps/myAgentsApp/` | myAgents-app-api (Sven), kein GUI — `https://myagents.lauer.team` |
| `Apps/myGunsApp/` | GUI (`myGuns-app-web`) + myGuns-app-api — `https://myguns.lauer.team` |
| `Apps/myDisplayApp/` | myDisplay-app-api + Pi/Web — `https://mydisplay.lauer.team` |
| `Apps/myWidgetsApp/` | myWidgets-app-api + Scriptable-Vorlagen — `https://mywidgets.lauer.team` |
| `Apps/myDownloadsApp/` | myDownloads-app-web + myDownloads-app-api (BFF) — `https://mydownloads.lauer.team` |
| `Apps/tempui/` | Sandbox — `https://tempui.lauer.team` |

